    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "4d0d7d6cef52838d15cd": "Darkmoon Faire Cards?  See the Professor here for those.  Come see me if you are a dealer in hard to come by antiquities and artifacts.",
        "54938cfab6b98a0e1cea": "What do you have for sale?",
        "653fc2ba7681ebf1845f": "Have you any idea what I go through to bring these incomparable valuables to sell?  Come see them all for yourself!",
        "b337f5560f99a7d2f67d": "Every item that I have for sale I acquired myself.  You have my personal guarantee of authenticity.",
        "cef5af94525ecd7e1e5d": "Come and take a look at my wares while you still can.  We're here all week, and then we're off to some far off land."
      },
      "name": "Lhara",
      "subName": "Darkmoon Faire Exotic Goods",
      "translationMetadata": {
